# $capability_id Artifact Index Contract

## Purpose

Define a metadata-only index for scaffold outputs.

## Required Fields

- `index_id`
- `capability_id`
- `metadata_only`
- `content_indexed`
- `entries`
- `artifact_index_manifest`

## Entry Fields

- `relative_path`
- `artifact_type`
- `contract_status`
- `notes`

## Boundary

- `content_indexed` defaults to `false`.
- Raw input content copying is out of scope.
- Runtime receipts from live systems are out of scope.
